# Optional: a Gemini API key baked in at build time, for local development only.
#
# You do NOT need this. The app has a Settings → API Key screen where each user
# supplies their own key, stored in their browser's local storage.
#
# Only set this if you want a key pre-filled while developing locally.
# NEVER set it for a build you intend to distribute — Vite inlines the value into
# the JavaScript bundle, so every user of that build would receive your key.
#
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
